{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/extras/3d13c40b403310f1e48bf10c2ef04660.poster.avif?t=1763984065\" width=400 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/extras/3d13c40b403310f1e48bf10c2ef04660.webm?t=1763984065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/extras/3d13c40b403310f1e48bf10c2ef04660.mp4?t=1763984065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Bliss TV World!</strong>\u00a0Home of the retro television.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into our cozy little shop and find yourself transported through time. From the earliest wooden sets to the sleek modern screens, every television here tells a story. Guests are encouraged to explore the cabin and uncover the history that hums through its walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/extras/d803166403167e631c5e8d2d85118593.avif?t=1763984065\" width=616 height=359 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tread carefully.</strong> Once you step outside, the forest grows thick, and the locals are known to protect their land with zeal.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumors say this region is haunted by more than just memories. Whispers of unseen creatures and flickers of ghostly light have surrounded Bliss TV World for years. Some claim the televisions themselves remember what they have seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/extras/e2d5cd274e370c7e8f2d677b3a3aa998.poster.avif?t=1763984065\" width=1170 height=824 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/extras/e2d5cd274e370c7e8f2d677b3a3aa998.webm?t=1763984065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/extras/e2d5cd274e370c7e8f2d677b3a3aa998.mp4?t=1763984065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The figures  in the corner of sight, the whispers behind your thoughts, the ever-present gaze on you, they are all part of something much darker.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/extras/9548b78ef2a03ea5af822eb3fd2aad55.poster.avif?t=1763984065\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/extras/9548b78ef2a03ea5af822eb3fd2aad55.webm?t=1763984065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/extras/9548b78ef2a03ea5af822eb3fd2aad55.mp4?t=1763984065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Beneath the cabin lies something dark, fervent and alive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Once you've seen them, you are bound to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Only the <strong>Evil Eye</strong> can protect you from their power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/extras/e6d3beb293a16d3e8bb3dbc0afb70ade.avif?t=1763984065\" width=592 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Protect yourself from evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And when the time comes, bring the fight to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/extras/2c39fe6764555629e51e546c270ab73e.avif?t=1763984065\" width=439 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Aesthetic:</strong>\u00a0The game uses low poly models and has a pixelated effect to further enhance the retro feeling while immersing the player in the world and increasing the fear factor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Gameplay:</strong> From working in a TV Store to fighting against enemies with a shotgun, <i>Periphery</i> is an experience that slowly takes the player from horror to action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Story:</strong>\u00a0Discover the secrets of Bliss TV and the horrors that are buried in it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content creators:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to create content from the game and monetize the gameplay.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044310?t=1763984065","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044310?t=1763984065","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/96aa973ed7f17459aa220b9576e30abb818f068e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763984065","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/96aa973ed7f17459aa220b9576e30abb818f068e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763984065","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood, dismemberment and gore"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/extras/3d13c40b403310f1e48bf10c2ef04660.poster.avif?t=1763984065\" width=400 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/extras/3d13c40b403310f1e48bf10c2ef04660.webm?t=1763984065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/extras/3d13c40b403310f1e48bf10c2ef04660.mp4?t=1763984065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Bliss TV World!</strong>\u00a0Home of the retro television.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into our cozy little shop and find yourself transported through time. From the earliest wooden sets to the sleek modern screens, every television here tells a story. Guests are encouraged to explore the cabin and uncover the history that hums through its walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/extras/d803166403167e631c5e8d2d85118593.avif?t=1763984065\" width=616 height=359 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tread carefully.</strong> Once you step outside, the forest grows thick, and the locals are known to protect their land with zeal.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumors say this region is haunted by more than just memories. Whispers of unseen creatures and flickers of ghostly light have surrounded Bliss TV World for years. Some claim the televisions themselves remember what they have seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/extras/e2d5cd274e370c7e8f2d677b3a3aa998.poster.avif?t=1763984065\" width=1170 height=824 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/extras/e2d5cd274e370c7e8f2d677b3a3aa998.webm?t=1763984065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/extras/e2d5cd274e370c7e8f2d677b3a3aa998.mp4?t=1763984065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The figures  in the corner of sight, the whispers behind your thoughts, the ever-present gaze on you, they are all part of something much darker.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/extras/9548b78ef2a03ea5af822eb3fd2aad55.poster.avif?t=1763984065\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/extras/9548b78ef2a03ea5af822eb3fd2aad55.webm?t=1763984065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/extras/9548b78ef2a03ea5af822eb3fd2aad55.mp4?t=1763984065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Beneath the cabin lies something dark, fervent and alive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Once you've seen them, you are bound to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Only the <strong>Evil Eye</strong> can protect you from their power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/extras/e6d3beb293a16d3e8bb3dbc0afb70ade.avif?t=1763984065\" width=592 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Protect yourself from evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And when the time comes, bring the fight to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/extras/2c39fe6764555629e51e546c270ab73e.avif?t=1763984065\" width=439 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Aesthetic:</strong>\u00a0The game uses low poly models and has a pixelated effect to further enhance the retro feeling while immersing the player in the world and increasing the fear factor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Gameplay:</strong> From working in a TV Store to fighting against enemies with a shotgun, <i>Periphery</i> is an experience that slowly takes the player from horror to action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Story:</strong>\u00a0Discover the secrets of Bliss TV and the horrors that are buried in it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content creators:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to create content from the game and monetize the gameplay.</p>","developers":["EvE Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044310/154cd2dbe7b13c8f27bdeae841a2ea8e9dcb675b/header.jpg?t=1763984065","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Periphery","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul c